error[E5009]: the closure cannot return a borrow derived from captured 'n'
  --> main.prism:6:38
    6 |     return app { if (it > 0) it else &n }
      |                                      ^^ returned here
  --> main.prism:6:39
    6 |     return app { if (it > 0) it else &n }
      |                                       ^ 'n' is captured here
   = note: the closure's type takes a borrowed input, so its returned borrow is tied to its reference parameters only (elision rules 1 and 3) and callers do not keep what it captures borrowed
   = help: pass 'n' to the closure as a reference parameter instead
